    "body":  "Task 4 adds the first runnable Sprint 1 catalog: NestJS product endpoints, the mobile Next.js menu with loading/empty/error states, sample data and API/component tests. It also documents local setup, contribution rules, the backlog and traceability (FR-01–03, NFR-17; Assignment 2 §6).\n\nThe CI workflow runs automatically for pull requests into `develop-Assignment2` and checks both apps in order: Install → Lint → Unit Test → Build. Local verification on 2026-10-21: both lints passed, API 5/5 tests passed, web 13/13 tests passed, web typecheck and both production builds passed.\n\nThis draft PR collects the hosted CI evidence required by Task 4.4. A separate, disposable demo PR will deliberately fail a single formatting expectation and will be closed without merging. Evidence and run URLs will be saved under `docs/evidence/ci/`.\n\nAcceptance remains pending review, the Task 1–3 prerequisite check and confirmation that the repository owner has made `ci` a required status check. The current contributor has push permission and cannot administer branch protection. Do not merge this draft as part of the evidence exercise.\n",
